<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean firms buy 27,500T of Indian rapeseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean firms buy 27,500T of Indian rapeseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Feed Buying Group on Friday bought 27,500 tonnes of Indian rapeseed meal from G.Premjee at between $140.61 and $141.61 a tonne C&amp;F, traders said.</p>
<p>They said the buyers group also bought 9,300 tonnes of Chinese cottonseed meal, 3,200 tonnes of Thai tapioca hard pellet and 3,000 tonnes of Chinese wheat bran pellet.  </p>
<p>Arrivals were set at the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Details for the tender results are as follows:</p>
<p> COMMODS	     TONNE     ARRIVAL  PRICE   SELLER</p>
<p> Rapeseed meal    13,500     Aug 20  $140.61  G.Premjee</p>
<p> Rapeseed meal    14,000     Sep 20  $141.61  G.Premjee</p>
<p> Cottonseed meal   3,300     Sep 20  $157.50  Sunkyong</p>
<p> Cottonseed meal   6,000     Oct 20  $158.50  Sunkyong</p>
<p> Tapioca	     3,200     Aug 20  $87.57   Toepfer</p>
<p> Wheat bran pellet 3,000     Jul 25  $131.85  Toepfer</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
